<title>MALAYSIA: SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD TEAM CHAMPIONSHIP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD TEAM CHAMPIONSHIP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PETALING JAYA, Malaysia 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results</p>
<p>in the women's world team squash championships on Friday:</p>
<p>Australia beat New Zealand 3-0</p>
<p>Michelle Martin beat Philippa Beams 9-0 9-4 9-0</p>
<p>Sarah FitzGerald beat Sarah Cook 9-5 9-4 9-0</p>
<p>Carol Owens beat Jade Wilson 9-5 9-3</p>
<p>England beat South Africa 3-0</p>
<p>Cassie Jackman beat Claire Nitch 9-2 9-6 9-5</p>
<p>Linda Charman beat Carla Venter 9-0 9-3 9-5</p>
<p>Fiona Geaves beat Angelique Clifton-Parks 9-7 9-5</p>
</text>
